docs {
  # GET /api/v1/jasamarga-ops

  The JasaMarga Tollroad Ops Command feed for the Jakarta–Cikampek corridor.
  **Public** (no auth, no DB) so the lead demo runs with zero setup.

  - When `TOMTOM_API_KEY` is set, the **ribbon segments + incidents are LIVE**
    from TomTom (Flow Segment Data + Incident Details), cached ~2 min in-process,
    and the index/insight/top-ruas are derived off them → `traffic_source: "tomtom"`.
  - Otherwise everything is synthetic, jittered per read → `traffic_source: "synthetic"`.

  **Source:** `apps/web/app/api/v1/jasamarga-ops/route.ts`
  → `lib/jasamarga/data.ts` (buildSnapshot) + `lib/jasamarga/tomtom.ts` (getLiveTraffic).

  ## Response (200) — `OpsSnapshot` (abridged, live example)
  ```json
  {
    "corridor": "Jakarta–Cikampek (Japek)",
    "updated_at": "29 Mei, 11.12",
    "traffic_source": "tomtom",
    "load_index": 0.9, "level": "Lancar", "emoji": "🟢",
    "avg_speed": 74, "avg_delay_min": 1, "active_incidents": 6,
    "insight": { "title": "Lalu lintas Lancar di koridor Jakarta–Cikampek", "text": "...", "action": "..." },
    "segments": [
      { "km_from": 0, "km_to": 9, "label": "Halim – Cikunir", "speed": 74, "delay_min": 0, "status": "lancar" }
    ],
    "landmarks": [ { "km": 2, "name": "GT Halim Utama", "kind": "gerbang" } ],
    "incidents": [
      { "id": "TT-0", "km": "KM 8", "type": "Kemacetan", "severity": 8.4, "status": "Berlangsung", "source": "TomTom Traffic", "source_type": "traffic", "reported": "25 mnt lalu", "detail": "Lalu lintas tidak bergerak. ..." }
    ],
    "top_ruas": [ { "name": "...", "km_range": "KM 67–72", "load": 4.6, "speed": 49, "delay_min": 1, "dominant": "Volume tinggi" } ],
    "predictions": [ { "question": "...", "probability": 72, "answer_label": "Mungkin", "reasoning": "...", "tone": "negative" } ],
    "interventions": [ { "id": "RKL-1", "title": "Contraflow ...", "impact_time_pct": -38, "impact_clear_min": 45, "risk": "sedang", "recommended": true, "officially_announced": false } ],
    "social": { "mentions_24h": 3066, "negativity": 7.1, "trend": [ ... ], "top_posts": [ ... ] },
    "official": [ ... ], "news": [ ... ],
    "forecast": [ { "hour": "11:00", "load": 0.9, "label": "Sekarang" } ],
    "travel_times": [ { "route": "Halim → Cikampek Utama", "via": "Layang MBZ (Gol I)", "minutes": 96, "normal_minutes": 55, "trend": "up", "best": true } ],
    "weather": [ { "zone": "Cikarang – Karawang", "condition": "Hujan ringan", "temp": 27, "impact": "sedang" } ],
    "sources": [
      { "name": "Traffic Flow (TomTom)", "type": "traffic", "status": "live", "items_24h": 1440, "last_sync": "baru saja" },
      { "name": "Media Sosial (X API)", "type": "medsos", "status": "demo", "items_24h": 3066, "last_sync": "—" }
    ]
  }
  ```

  > Note: only Traffic Flow + Incidents are wired to TomTom; social/news/weather/official are `status: "demo"` (fabricated). See the TomTom folder for the upstream calls.
}
